                            <h1 id="wbb-quick-facts-title">2026-27 Baton Rouge Community College Bears Baseball Quick Facts</h1>
<p><strong>Prefer a printable version?</strong>&nbsp;<a href="/sports/bsb/2026-27/files/BB_Fall_Quick_Facts_web.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download the 2026-27 Baseball Quick Facts (PDF)</a></p>
<p><em>The accessible version of this information is provided on this webpage.</em></p>
<h2>Program Quick Facts</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Location (Population):</strong>&nbsp;Baton Rouge, LA (29,493)</li>
<li><strong>Founded:</strong>&nbsp;1998</li>
<li><strong>Enrollment:</strong>&nbsp;15,503</li>
<li><strong>Nickname:</strong>&nbsp;Bears / Lady Bears</li>
<li><strong>Colors:</strong>&nbsp;Red, White and Black</li>
<li><strong>Conference:</strong>&nbsp;Louisiana Community College Athletic Conference</li>
<li><strong>Arena (Capacity):</strong>&nbsp;Bonne Sante Wellness Center (2,775)</li>
<li><strong>Chancellor:</strong>&nbsp;Willie E. Smith Sr., Ed.D.</li>
<li><strong>Athletic Director:</strong>&nbsp;Brock Kantrow</li>
<li><strong>Athletic Department Phone:</strong>&nbsp;225-216-8166</li>
<li><strong>Athletic Coordinator:</strong>&nbsp;Joseph Wojciechowski</li>
</ul>
<h2>Coaching Staff</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Head Coach:</strong>&nbsp;Jonathan Parker (1st Season)</li>
<li><strong>Record at BRCC:</strong>&nbsp;0-0</li>
<li><strong>Assistant Coach:</strong>&nbsp;Braxton Boudoin</li>
<li><strong>Assistant Coach:</strong>&nbsp;Chase Honeycutt</li>
<li><strong>Baseball Engagement Coordinator</strong>: Sam Goncalves</li>
</ul>
<h2>Team Information</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>2026 Record:</strong>&nbsp;6-49</li>
<li><strong>2026 LCCAC Record (Finish):</strong>&nbsp;1-20 (4th)</li>
<li><strong>Returners:</strong>&nbsp;16</li>
<li><strong>Newcomers:</strong>&nbsp;24</li>
</ul>
<h2>History</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>First Year of Baseball:</strong>&nbsp;2004-2005</li>
<li><strong>All-Time Record:</strong>&nbsp;423-732-2</li>
</ul>
<h2>Athletic Media Relations</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Address:</strong>&nbsp;201 Community College Drive, Baton Rouge, LA 70816</li>
<li><strong>Website:</strong>&nbsp;<a href="https://www.brccathletics.com/">Visit BRCC Athletics</a></li>
<li><strong>Twitter/X:</strong>&nbsp;@brccathletics, @BRCC_Baseball</li>
<li><strong>Instagram</strong>: brccathletics, brcc_bearsbaseball</li>
<li><strong>Facebook:</strong>&nbsp;<a href="https://www.facebook.com/brccathletics">Visit BRCC Athletics on Facebook</a></li>
<li><strong>YouTube:</strong>&nbsp;<a href="//www.youtube.com/channel/UCEQZ6KlZD4WZFFYCX1bCsIw">Visit BRCC Athletics on YouTube</a></li>
<li><strong>TikTok:</strong>&nbsp;@brccathletic ,brccbaseball</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2>2026 Fall Schedule</h2>
<h4>September</h4>
<ul>
<li>Sept. 11- vs San Jacinto College- 11:00 am- McMurray Park- Sulphur, LA</li>
<li>Sept. 11- vs Nunez Community College- 5:00 pm- McMurray Park- Sulphur, LA&nbsp;</li>
<li>Sept. 18- vs Coastal Alabama South- 10:30 am- LSU Alex Box Stadium</li>
<li>Sept. 18- vs East Central Community College- 5:30 pm- LSU Alex Box Stadium</li>
<li>Sept. 25- vs Nunez Community College- 9:30 am- Nicholls State University Ray E Didier Field</li>
</ul>
<h4>October</h4>
<ul>
<li>Oct 4-&nbsp; @ Southern University- 1:00 pm</li>
<li>Oct 6.- @ Copiah Lincoln Community College- 12:00 pm DH&nbsp;</li>
<li>Oct. 10- Fall World Series- BRCC Alumni/ Family Day- 10:00 am</li>
<li>Oct. 15- @ LSUA- TBD</li>
</ul>
